Package: favia
Version: __FAVIA_VERSION__
Architecture: __ARCH__
Section: video
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Simon Zolin <stsaz@pm.me>
Depends: libc6
Description: Fast video player (and image viewer) for Linux & Windows.
 favia is a fast video player based on ffmpeg and SDL. It supports
 hardware decoding (VAAPI/CUDA on Linux, D3D11 on Windows), can view
 images, and play multiple files in separate windows.
